---

- `/adventure site` — plaque for the site you are standing in
- `/adventure site accept` / `leave`
- `/adventure reload` — reread the overlay (op)
- `/adventure cooldown` — forget the nearby site so it can roll again (op)
- `/adventure cooldown all` — this dimension (op)
- `/adventure debug event` — fire a test event on you (op)

Use `cooldown` when you are iterating a datapack and the same temple keeps saying “come back later.”

Not done, do not promise these in a pack page: world events, adventure bosses, adventure modifiers, parties, a campaign generator, structure worldgen rules.
